    <title>dotnet/dotnet-monitor - Releases - 2025-09-09</title>
    <id>https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-monitor#2025-09-09</id>
    <link href="https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-monitor" />
    <updated>2025-09-10T00:06:12Z</updated>
    <content type="html">
                &lt;div&gt;
                    
                        &lt;article&gt;
                            &lt;h2&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-monitor/releases/tag/v10.0.0-rc.1.25453.1"&gt;Dotnet-Monitor Release - v10.0.0-rc.1.25453.1&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
                            &lt;div&gt;
                                &lt;p&gt;Today we are releasing the official 10.0.0 Release Candidate of the &lt;code&gt;dotnet monitor&lt;/code&gt; tool. This release includes:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Added support for resetting in process features when dotnet-monitor is restarted. (&lt;a href="https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-monitor/pull/8154" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/dotnet/dotnet-monitor/pull/8154/hovercard"&gt;#8154&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Add &lt;code&gt;ManagedEntryPointAssemblyName&lt;/code&gt; to process info and collection rule filters (&lt;a href="https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-monitor/pull/7984" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/dotnet/dotnet-monitor/pull/7984/hovercard"&gt;#7984&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Add &lt;code&gt;Capabilities&lt;/code&gt; to &lt;code&gt;/info&lt;/code&gt; route. (&lt;a href="https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-monitor/pull/7977" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/dotnet/dotnet-monitor/pull/7977/hovercard"&gt;#7977&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🔬 Added &lt;code&gt;ModuleVersionId&lt;/code&gt; and &lt;code&gt;MethodToken&lt;/code&gt; Fields to Parameter Capture Output (&lt;a href="https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-monitor/pull/7974" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/dotnet/dotnet-monitor/pull/7974/hovercard"&gt;#7974&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fix an issue where &lt;code&gt;/stacks&lt;/code&gt; route can fail to collect call stacks after &lt;code&gt;/parameters&lt;/code&gt; route is used (&lt;a href="https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-monitor/pull/7914" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/dotnet/dotnet-monitor/pull/7914/hovercard"&gt;#7914&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fixed an issue with custom tags not showing up for &lt;code&gt;Histogram&lt;/code&gt; and &lt;code&gt;UpDownCounter&lt;/code&gt; meters (&lt;a href="https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-monitor/pull/7697" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/dotnet/dotnet-monitor/pull/7697/hovercard"&gt;#7697&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hide frames with &lt;a href="https://learn.microsoft.com/dotnet/api/system.diagnostics.stacktracehiddenattribute" rel="nofollow"&gt;&lt;code&gt;StackTraceHiddenAttribute&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/a&gt; from &lt;code&gt;/exceptions&lt;/code&gt; and &lt;code&gt;/stacks&lt;/code&gt;. When retrieving json data these frames are still included but are identified by a new &lt;code&gt;hidden&lt;/code&gt; field. (&lt;a href="https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-monitor/pull/7532" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/dotnet/dotnet-monitor/pull/7532/hovercard"&gt;#7532&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use the &lt;code&gt;DOTNET&lt;/code&gt; prefix when detecting environment variables and prefer it over the &lt;code&gt;COMPlus&lt;/code&gt; prefix. (&lt;a href="https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-monitor/pull/7434" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/dotnet/dotnet-monitor/pull/7434/hovercard"&gt;#7434&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;*🔬 &lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;indicates an experimental feature&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you would like to provide additional feedback to the team &lt;a href="https://aka.ms/dotnet-monitor-survey?src=rn" rel="nofollow"&gt;please fill out this survey&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;details&gt;
&lt;summary&gt;Packages released to NuGet&lt;/summary&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;code&gt;dotnet-monitor.10.0.0-rc.1.25453.1.nupkg&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/details&gt;
                            &lt;/div&gt;
                        &lt;/article&gt;
                    
